    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d70">

                <pb facs="0100" n="46" xml:id="pg46"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 EW/9–1444:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >niact</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-09-14">September 14, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7558. Personal for the Secretary.</p>
                <p>Eden left last night for Quebec Conference by air. I understand he is going more
                    in his capacity as unofficial Deputy Defense Minister than as Foreign
                    Secretary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
